A nominal lot cost does not hide an invalid transaction price on the default commodity.

========== API ==========

aggregate()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Incorrect price
  Assets:Cash  100 SEK {1 SEK} @ 2 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:Cash",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "100"
  },
  {
    "account": "Equity:Opening",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "-100"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========

[INVALID_COMMODITY_TRADE] Transaction price expressed in the posting commodity SEK must value one SEK at exactly one SEK
  {{JOURNAL_PATH}}:7:3
